{"schema":"mcpgit.table-batch-transaction.v1","transaction_id":"82755fc0-66f2-5479-8dfa-f705ed9beec0","idempotency_key":"82755fc0-66f2-5479-8dfa-f705ed9beec0","actor":{"kind":"github-action","repository":"yxsicd/agentlabrelease","runId":"36668422345","runUrl":"https://github.com/yxsicd/agentlabrelease/actions/runs/36668422345"},"recorded_at_unix_ms":1790742236981,"tables":[{"path":"program_facts","operations":[{"op":"insert","operation_id":"94c1eea7-77d6-59bc-af20-8a6a89da62d0","key":"agent-analysis-arkui-descriptor-builder-modifier-codegen","row":{"id":"agent-analysis-arkui-descriptor-builder-modifier-codegen","kind":"analysis","payload":{"agentProposal":{"automaticPromotion":false,"schema":"agentlab.maintainer_skill_fact_proposal.v1","sourceAssessmentSha256":"ca8b80ee731bd8859f88e2b8d8c03afdb7b3c5cec6e261f62df94fae753afcab"},"dimensions":["behavior","boundary","relations","responsibility"],"evidence":[{"gitBlobOid":"6f96cf4f26d8beaeabef56967f213c050d126d5e","path":"features/componentlibrary/src/main/ets/componentdetailview/picker/calendarPicker/viewmodel/CalendarPickerAttributeModifier.ets"},{"gitBlobOid":"d7c00dfba71c599fcb3d144146e5bb65236d73bf","path":"features/componentlibrary/src/main/ets/componentdetailview/toggleview/viewmodel/ToggleCodeGenerator.ets"},{"gitBlobOid":"58f70c819cae24dbe5343c74afa2e2e2a94bfeb8","path":"features/componentlibrary/src/main/ets/componentdetailview/textview/component/TextBuilder.ets"}],"id":"agent-analysis-arkui-descriptor-builder-modifier-codegen","interpretation":"The scope is the input/display slice of componentlibrary's component-detail catalog (buttonview, picker/*, rating, styletext, textarea, textinput, textview, toggleview). Each family repeats one mechanism: an exported @Builder function accepts a DescriptorWrapper and either renders a host component with .attributeModifier(new XAttributeModifier($$.descriptor)) (e.g. TextBuilder) or forwards the typed descriptor to a @Component child (CameraPickerBuilder -> CameraPickerComponent). @Observed descriptor classes extend CommonAttributeModifier, whose assignAttribute maps optional descriptor fields to attribute calls only when defined (CalendarPickerAttributeModifier maps edgeAlign -> instance.edgeAlign(val?.alignType, val?.offset) and textStyle). CodeGenerator classes implement CommonCodeGenerator: generate(attributes: OriginAttribute[]) switches over attribute names against per-family entity maps (e.g. toggleType/isOn/backgroundColor from ToggleAttributeMapping), applies defaults via DEFAULT_KEY when values are missing or unrecognized, and returns a templated @Component source string; ToggleCodeGenerator branches the emitted template on ToggleType.Button vs other types and derives textColor from the parsed isOn boolean. The public boundary is the set of exported @Builder functions, descriptor/modifier/generator classes and entity map data; internal state is private. Maintenance contract: adding a component detail means adding sibling Builder/Descriptor/AttributeModifier/CodeGenerator/Mapping files wired to shared CommonAttributeModifier/CommonCodeGenerator/DescriptorWrapper in viewmodel/, keeping builder-to-descriptor casts consistent and generator defaults aligned with map data.","kind":"analysis","limitations":["Shared CommonAttributeModifier/CommonCodeGenerator and DescriptorWrapper semantics outside the scope are assumed, not inspected.","Runtime build/playground rendering of generated code strings is unverified; the @Builder-to-viewmodel wiring for all eight families is inferred from the uniform pattern, not exhaustively read."],"repositoryId":"code-workshop","scopeSkillIds":["skill-scope-code-workshop-componentlibrary-input-display"],"sourceRevision":"7aa95cac4eca15e39fc6638cdf1de7db6fb70ad6"},"payloadSha256":"b97bc17f0e15df29498f120a37623984b429d21799848bb4e175f27e31d5e631","repositoryId":"code-workshop","sourceRevision":"7aa95cac4eca15e39fc6638cdf1de7db6fb70ad6"}},{"op":"insert","operation_id":"a0cb8fff-a11e-5244-9fdc-966675b4fef6","key":"agent-analysis-common-mvvm-ui-state-contract","row":{"id":"agent-analysis-common-mvvm-ui-state-contract","kind":"analysis","payload":{"agentProposal":{"automaticPromotion":false,"schema":"agentlab.maintainer_skill_fact_proposal.v1","sourceAssessmentSha256":"ca8b80ee731bd8859f88e2b8d8c03afdb7b3c5cec6e261f62df94fae753afcab"},"dimensions":["behavior","boundary","relations","responsibility"],"evidence":[{"gitBlobOid":"c790c21f09d3cf38c9872378baf50dc174f159be","path":"common/src/main/ets/viewmodel/BaseVM.ets"},{"gitBlobOid":"29b27760fbc21ac7db1430e71f385621f09ad1be","path":"common/src/main/ets/viewmodel/BaseState.ets"},{"gitBlobOid":"df695e0e45bbabc6d207d9105a4fd1e16a232feb","path":"common/src/main/ets/component/WebSheet.ets"}],"id":"agent-analysis-common-mvvm-ui-state-contract","interpretation":"The common module's UI state contract rests on two complementary mechanisms. (1) An MVVM base triple: BaseState is an intentionally empty marker class; BaseVM<T extends BaseState> is the abstract store holding a protected `state` assigned once from initialState in the constructor, exposing public getState():T and mandating abstract sendEvent(BaseVMEvent) — feature ViewMs subclass with a concrete state type, keep mutation behind sendEvent, and events flow one-way in. Any change to state visibility, getState's return, or sendEvent's signature breaks every subclass ViewModel's compile contract. (2) A component-level observable-state contract exemplified by WebSheet: inputs are @Prop url/urlType (plus exported WebUrlType GITCODE/HARMONYOS), reactive app-wide slices arrive via @StorageProp(StorageKey.GLOBAL_INFO / WEB_LOADING), and local render state is @State loadFailed flipped only by checkWebLoaded() (initially invoked in aboutToAppear); build() enforces a deterministic precedence — web NodeContainer with a urlType-derived negative top offset (57 vs 56), else LoadingView while isLoading, else NoNetworkView whose retry callback re-runs checkWebLoaded(). Maintenance must preserve this loading>failed precedence, the AppStorage key names, and the exported WebSheetBuilder(url,urlType) @Builder entry point that feature modules bind through. Shared constant enums (FormCardAction CALL/ROUTER, CallMethod) act as stable cross-module action keys.","kind":"analysis","limitations":["BaseVMEvent.ets was not preloaded; the event taxonomy and sendEvent dispatch semantics are inferred only from BaseVM's abstract signature and import.","WebUtil.checkWebLoaded/getWebNode and the producers of AppStorage keys GLOBAL_INFO/WEB_LOADING lie outside the scope; their update/persistence behavior is unproved."],"repositoryId":"code-workshop","scopeSkillIds":["skill-scope-code-workshop-common-ui-state-contracts"],"sourceRevision":"7aa95cac4eca15e39fc6638cdf1de7db6fb70ad6"},"payloadSha256":"56487817271fa86e96ff72f519811d5028abc8eb00a64fa1b5e4ea5a52c1b792","repositoryId":"code-workshop","sourceRevision":"7aa95cac4eca15e39fc6638cdf1de7db6fb70ad6"}},{"op":"insert","operation_id":"ab2a2e20-8d4e-5897-bcbe-8bcced166292","key":"agent-analysis-componentlibrary-detail-view-vm-orchestration","row":{"id":"agent-analysis-componentlibrary-detail-view-vm-orchestration","kind":"analysis","payload":{"agentProposal":{"automaticPromotion":false,"schema":"agentlab.maintainer_skill_fact_proposal.v1","sourceAssessmentSha256":"ca8b80ee731bd8859f88e2b8d8c03afdb7b3c5cec6e261f62df94fae753afcab"},"dimensions":["behavior","boundary","relations","responsibility"],"evidence":[{"gitBlobOid":"5fb9f2d8a5bd2692817e99bdb8013ed8d39bf1af","path":"features/componentlibrary/src/main/ets/view/ComponentDetailView.ets"},{"gitBlobOid":"19e7c71d75db2a5e39e874312b64072dda2e08c8","path":"features/componentlibrary/src/main/ets/viewmodel/ComponentDetailManager.ets"},{"gitBlobOid":"f83f2a1fa0a9e8acec79c87afd27221f4d468b40","path":"features/componentlibrary/Index.ets"}],"id":"agent-analysis-componentlibrary-detail-view-vm-orchestration","interpretation":"componentlibrary exposes only three exports via Index.ets (ComponentHomeView, ComponentListModel, componentDetailConfig) and registers four NavDestination routes in router_map.json (ComponentListView, ComponentDetailView, CodePreviewView, PenKitView) bound to @Builder functions. Core responsibility is detail-page orchestration in ComponentDetailView: on assignViewData it reuses a ComponentDetailPageVM from the ComponentDetailManager singleton map keyed by componentName or creates one, assigns the NavPathStack, awaits InitComponentEvent(componentId), then drives INIT_DESCRIPTOR, INIT_RECOMMEND, WEB_CODE_EVENT in order via a displaySync frame pump (60–120Hz range), refreshing componentDetailState and clearing backPressed after each frame, stopping the pump on completion or rejection. onBackPressed swallows back by sending ChangeBackPressed(true)+BackPage when state.backPressed is false; onDisAppear releases displaySync; failures surface as VM loadingStatus (FAILED). Also wires breakpoint watch on GLOBAL_INFO, COLOR_MODE-driven status bar style, and a feedback sheet toolbar action. Maintenance contract: preserve singleton VM reuse, frame-ordered event sequence, back-press flag protocol, the three-export surface, and route-name/builder mappings.","kind":"analysis","limitations":["PenKitView route target (componentdetailview/penkit/...) lies outside the ownership selectors; its builder contract is unverified.","@ohos.common/@ohos.commonbusiness dependency exports are assumed from imports, not proven from dependency sources."],"repositoryId":"code-workshop","scopeSkillIds":["skill-scope-code-workshop-componentlibrary-framework"],"sourceRevision":"7aa95cac4eca15e39fc6638cdf1de7db6fb70ad6"},"payloadSha256":"aa3b60fff0a3d4ac7441d0fac91f037c3e9a574b28b4a88b70df8c40ff57ffa7","repositoryId":"code-workshop","sourceRevision":"7aa95cac4eca15e39fc6638cdf1de7db6fb70ad6"}},{"op":"insert","operation_id":"c58da285-cb70-5ead-97e7-ab9d61429044","key":"agent-analysis-layout-collection-codegen-and-attribute-modifiers","row":{"id":"agent-analysis-layout-collection-codegen-and-attribute-modifiers","kind":"analysis","payload":{"agentProposal":{"automaticPromotion":false,"schema":"agentlab.maintainer_skill_fact_proposal.v1","sourceAssessmentSha256":"ca8b80ee731bd8859f88e2b8d8c03afdb7b3c5cec6e261f62df94fae753afcab"},"dimensions":["behavior","boundary","relations","responsibility"],"evidence":[{"gitBlobOid":"bbbb8d3e209d3d805a62fa1e734c82c16ad4a031","path":"features/componentlibrary/src/main/ets/componentdetailview/grid/viewmodel/GridCodeGenerator.ets"},{"gitBlobOid":"8494195d303838cb18049ebc7e1baeb431c3b90e","path":"features/componentlibrary/src/main/ets/componentdetailview/rowview/viewmodel/RowAttributeModifier.ets"},{"gitBlobOid":"cf8b90ac5f7827bad7544e987f67af1297c2344c","path":"features/componentlibrary/src/main/ets/componentdetailview/columnview/viewmodel/ColumnAttributeModifier.ets"}],"id":"agent-analysis-layout-collection-codegen-and-attribute-modifiers","interpretation":"The componentdetailview layout-collection scope (columnview, flex, grid, list, rowview, stackview, swiperView, tabview, waterflow) implements a uniform per-component pattern: a viewmodel CodeGenerator consumes OriginAttribute[] and emits a complete ArkUI component source snippet; an AttributeMapping entity supplies map data keyed by DEFAULT_KEY for default attribute code; a Descriptor holds typed attribute state; and an @Observed AttributeModifier extends CommonAttributeModifier<Descriptor, Attribute>, overriding applyNormalAttribute to push descriptor getters onto the rendered instance via assignAttribute (e.g. Row/Column alignItems, Stack alignContent). GridCodeGenerator.generate mutates private fields by switching on attribute.name (columnsGap, rowsGap, columnsNum/rowsNum via StringUtil.getTemplateString, operationMode via JSON.parse), then returns a template literal containing the Grid's scroller, gap, template and drag/drop behavior (onItemDragStart/onItemDrop with pixelMapBuilder from grid/component/PixelMapBuilder). Public boundary per component: the exported generator class, descriptor type, and modifier class; cross-boundary relations point to shared ../../../viewmodel/CommonCodeGenerator, CommonAttributeModifier, Attribute (OriginAttribute), util/StringUtil, and sibling ../../common/entity/CommonMapData. Observable contract: given the same attribute list, each generator deterministically regenerates component source with defaults replaced by current values; modifiers deterministically map descriptor fields to one or more instance attribute calls. Maintenance must keep generator switch cases, mapping keys, and modifier applyNormalAttribute bindings in lockstep across all nine layout families.","kind":"analysis","limitations":["CommonAttributeModifier.assignAttribute and CommonCodeGenerator shared implementations are outside the preloaded evidence and their exact dispatch semantics are unverified.","Whether all nine component families instantiate these generators/modifiers identically at runtime (view/page wiring) is not shown by the inspected blobs."],"repositoryId":"code-workshop","scopeSkillIds":["skill-scope-code-workshop-componentlibrary-layout-collections"],"sourceRevision":"7aa95cac4eca15e39fc6638cdf1de7db6fb70ad6"},"payloadSha256":"5b111b65924148a42c83c640976663e45e4205aeb8914d40303ba01286e03a85","repositoryId":"code-workshop","sourceRevision":"7aa95cac4eca15e39fc6638cdf1de7db6fb70ad6"}}],"results":[{"operation_id":"94c1eea7-77d6-59bc-af20-8a6a89da62d0","op":"insert","key":"agent-analysis-arkui-descriptor-builder-modifier-codegen","previous_row_version":null,"row_version":1,"deleted":false},{"operation_id":"a0cb8fff-a11e-5244-9fdc-966675b4fef6","op":"insert","key":"agent-analysis-common-mvvm-ui-state-contract","previous_row_version":null,"row_version":1,"deleted":false},{"operation_id":"ab2a2e20-8d4e-5897-bcbe-8bcced166292","op":"insert","key":"agent-analysis-componentlibrary-detail-view-vm-orchestration","previous_row_version":null,"row_version":1,"deleted":false},{"operation_i